# 与上游一致：维护者已明确授权公开这对实验签名身份（私钥本就是公开的），
# 因此这里放行这两个文件。哈希钉在 keys/published/fingerprints.json，并由
# tools/check_public_tree.py 逐次核验；其他任何 *.pem 仍然禁止入库。
!keys/published/A7M4_updater_private.pem
!keys/published/A7M4_updater_public.pem
!fastboot/assets/fastboot.bin
!fastboot/assets/uart_boot.ino.uf2

# Generated macOS launcher bundle (rebuild with tools/make_app_macos.py)
*.app/
